# Test that dependencyTree works despite eviction errors (issue #7255)
#
# Setup: Creates a binary incompatible eviction scenario using local modules:
# - base 1.0.0 with early-semver versioning
# - base 2.0.0 (major version bump = binary incompatible)
# - middle depends on base 1.0.0
# - app depends on middle + base 2.0.0 (eviction conflict!)
#
# Before the fix: dependencyTree would fail with eviction error
# After the fix: dependencyTree displays the tree (eviction shown as warning)

# Publish base 1.0.0
> base/publish

# Publish base 2.0.0
> set base/version := "2.0.0"
> base/publish

# Publish middle (depends on base 1.0.0)
> middle/publish

# This is the key test: dependencyTree should succeed despite eviction error
> app/dependencyTree

# Additional verification via custom task
> checkDependencyTree
